== Effects ==
* Gives a chance to drop a {{e|Bomb}} when [[Coins|money]] is collected.
** {{dlc|nr}} 50% chance.
** {{dlc+|r}} The chance is based on the coin's worth:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.75<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
