 | 76.27%
 |-
 | {{E|Dime}}
 | 94.37%
 |}
{{dlc-}}

* {{dlc|nr}} {{e|Bomb}}s may be any normal type with their respective usual chances.
* {{dlc|r}} Only regular {{e|Bomb}}s can spawn normally, but {{e|Double Bomb}}s can spawn with certain synergies.

== Notes ==
* This trinket can be found from destroying {{E|TNT}} barrels and {{E|Special Shopkeeper}}s
** {{dlc|r}} It can also spawn in a rare room with fires found in {{S|Depths}}.
* Can show up in the [[Beans!]] challenge, without being unlocked.
* Can always appear in a specific room layout, even prior to unlocking it.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|BOGO Bombs}}/{{i|Humbleing Bundle|nr}}: All normal {{e|Bomb}}s spawned by the trinket become {{e|Double Bomb}}s.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{i|Humbleing Bundle}}: All normal {{e|Bomb}}s spawned by the trinket get a 50% chance to turn into {{e|Double Bomb}}s.{{dlc-}}
* {{C|Tainted Keeper}}: The trinket works with the temporary coins spawned from defeating enemies, effectively turning it into an infinite {{e|Bomb}} generator.
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Increases the chances to:<ref>The chance is calculated as 1-0.5<sup>(coin_worth)</sup></ref>
